currency request bodies with closed, op-specific schemas.\n- Reuse the directory signed-request envelope and replay guard; verification goes through `verify_strict` only, and the pipeline resolves device → account before registry authorization.\n- Add typed verification/authorization errors, deterministic BLAKE3 idempotency IDs, and the design §9.3 decision to use the stable hash ID rather than durable monotonic counter state.\n- Add focused tests for round-trip, body tampering, stale timestamps, nonce replay, strict-verification forgery, non-minter rejection, canonical/closed decoding, and deterministic IDs.\n\n## Scope and remaining work\nThis PR delivers the transport-independent F3 envelope plus resolver and registry interfaces/fixtures. It does not implement the currency registry (#2317), account factory (#2318), or ledger submission and receipt path. Those integration pieces remain explicit follow-up scope on #2319; this PR intentionally does not close the issue.\n\nRefs #2319\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-08T11:09:57Z","updated_at":"2026-11-14T16:45:10Z","closed_at":"2026-11-14T16:45:07Z","merged_at":"2026-11-14T16:45:07Z","merge_commit_sha":"fa7412cfd788340197d9c2033122e7ac9e068318","assignee":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","ev